    },
    {
        "text": "Great Kereseira, gentle and brave, not even the night can hide your splendor.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Drunken Craftsman"
    },
    {
        "text": "You brought us a wise duo to solve our troubles and help us build your temple.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Drunken Craftsman"
    },
    {
        "text": "The insects sing the song of your harp, your laurel is woven into the shape of victory, and the moonlight\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Drunken Craftsman"
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh, sorry, it's not moonlight that shines upon you, but the spotlights that we installed last week.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Drunken Craftsman"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_drinkwine_generous"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_drinkwine_generous"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_drinkwine_generous"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "(Hearty drinking)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Drunken Craftsman"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2074_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sober Craftsman"
    },
    {
        "text": "Don't drink too much. We're here to vote, remember? You don't want to hurt your hand engraving your ostracon.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sober Craftsman"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2072_1#1$2",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Of course I remember! I'm here to vote for Titi!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Drunken Craftsman"
    },
    {
        "text": "I almost fell when I was working on the statues by myself in the temple. I wouldn't be drinking here right now if Titi didn't save me with her Arts!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Drunken Craftsman"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2074_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Uh...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sober Craftsman"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2072_1#1$2",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "You don't believe me?",
        "tag": "multiline",
        "name": "Drunken Craftsman"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_walk_n",
        "volume": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "posfrom": "0,0",
        "posto": "-200,0",
        "afrom": 1,
        "ato": 0,
        "duration": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Let me show you. I tripped over the statue's sash that trails on the floor, and then\u2014",
        "tag": "multiline",
        "name": "Drunken Craftsman"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.3,
        "xstrength": 30,
        "ystrength": 30,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "text": "Whoa!",
        "tag": "multiline",
        "name": "Drunken Craftsman"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_clothmovementsp",
        "volume": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 1,
        "xstrength": 10,
        "ystrength": 10,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "text": "Look out!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "text": "Several white ribbons fly out of the shadows towards the drunken Forte girl, helping her steady herself."
    },
    {
        "text": "They let her go once they ascertain that she is unharmed, straightening her hair while patting her horns in reproach."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_clothmovement",
        "volume": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2072_1#1$2",
        "posfrom": "-200,-30",
        "posto": "0,0",
        "afrom": 0,
        "ato": 1,
        "duration": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2072_1#1$2",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "See? Those ribbons saved my ass, just like that.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Drunken Craftsman"
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh, Titi! What are you doing here? Let's get a drink!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Drunken Craftsman"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#9$1",
        "duration": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Pallas told me about a girl in the moving crew who's small but strong. She loves drinking and has a tendency to stumble.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Titi"
    },
    {
        "text": "But I didn't expect to see you stumble a dozen times in just three days, Kantia.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Titi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2072_1#1$2",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Thanks, Titi.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Drunken Craftsman"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2074_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "She doesn't hold her drink any better than the average Minoan, which is to say she's supposed to drink in moderation. But she has a drunkard's soul.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sober Craftsman"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#9$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hehe...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Titi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2074_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "You need a swig, Titi?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sober Craftsman"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#5$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Do I look that nervous?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Titi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2074_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Not on your face, but we've all figured out that your tail doesn't lie.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sober Craftsman"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#12$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Mm...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Titi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2074_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Who's the guy under the scaffolds, wearing a leaf-shaped ring on his grey tail?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sober Craftsman"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Serafim from the paint crew. He's only motivated when working with big, muscular dudes. Nobody believes him when he says he's just lazy.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Titi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2074_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "What about the Elafia sitting in the corner, not talking to anyone?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sober Craftsman"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#10$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Lefteria, from the sculpting crew. She always stays out of the sun. I've only talked to her a few times, but I know she's obsessive about her work.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Titi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2074_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "That's more than most of us know about her. Most of the craftsmen barely know she exists.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sober Craftsman"
    },
    {
        "text": "I don't know about the others, Titi, but to me, you're one of us.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sober Craftsman"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "...!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Titi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#9$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Thanks, Manos.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Titi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopsound",
