    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#7$1"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_2068_1#3$1"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "style": "slider",
        "inverse": true,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_2068_1#3$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Shouldn't you be comforting your friend? She looks nervous.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kassandra"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Comforting people is your job, Kassandra of Endymion Temple.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Pallas"
    },
    {
        "text": "What Titi needs now is not the reassurance of a friend, but the support of the Minoans participating in the temple project.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Pallas"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_2068_1#3$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Kyr\u00eda Mashayer has been reciting her speech silently before those two craftsmen struck up a conversation with her.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kassandra"
    },
    {
        "text": "She subconsciously clutches her tail whenever she trips over a word. Twice she accidentally grabbed her little pet instead, much to its annoyance.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kassandra"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#10$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "You've been observing her carefully. I think you like her.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Pallas"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_2068_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kassandra"
    },
    {
        "text": "This alone is not enough to prove that she's worthy of trust. I just didn't want to surrender my own judgment to prejudice.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kassandra"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_2068_1#3$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "It didn't take you long to decide that she was the best choice to supervise the project. I trust <i>your</i> judgment.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kassandra"
    },
    {
        "text": "Tonight, there is no shadow of confusion in those reflected in Kereseira's eyes. Everyone has made their decisions. They do not need the words of the heroes to guide their way.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kassandra"
    },
    {
        "text": "I have some personal matters to attend to. Excuse me.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kassandra"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "You're going?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Pallas"
    },
    {
        "text": "The Astynomos might take the absence of the supervising priest from the voting as a form of protest.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Pallas"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_2068_1#7$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "My ostracon is already in the box. Besides, Lydia has no need for such blatant excuses, if she wants to pick a bone with the priesthood.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kassandra"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "If the exchange ceremony takes place at the First Temple, then the ceremonial play to honor the heroes...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Pallas"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_2068_1#3$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'll talk to Lydia again, at least get her to defer to the priests when it comes to choosing the play.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kassandra"
    },
    {
        "text": "But that's all for another day. Let's hope tonight's vote goes smoothly.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kassandra"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
