    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_mictest",
        "volume": 0.5,
        "channel": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2.5
    },
    {
        "text": "\u2014Based on my experiences these past few days, once we solved the issue with the stone, I believe the structure is essentially complete and ready to welcome visitors.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Titi"
    },
    {
        "text": "It will be ready to open in a few days once we put on the finishing touches and complete the inspections according to plan.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Titi"
    },
    {
        "text": "There wouldn't be too much work to do to set up the exchange ceremony on the square. We'd just need to clear some room for the ceremony itself, and have a separate area for logistics.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Titi"
    },
    {
        "text": "We don't need to change anything with the rest of the building; it'll be ready to open once construction is complete.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Titi"
    },
    {
        "text": "I will create an actionable proposal based on my knowledge and experience overseeing construction projects.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Titi"
    },
    {
        "text": "If I'm elected, we will work together to complete the wonder that is Kereseira's First Temple!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Titi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2067_1#1$1",
        "duration": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lydia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_walk_n",
        "volume": 0.6
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2078_1#1$1",
        "duration": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_2078_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_2067_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Such a lively sight! It seems this Kyr\u00eda Mashayer has made a lot of friends in a short time.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Per\u00edandros"
    },
    {
        "text": "It would undoubtedly be a massive boon to the friendship between our two countries, not to mention the temple project, if she's elected.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Per\u00edandros"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_2067_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "What do you want?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lydia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_2078_1#10$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm not sure what you mean. I'm here to attend the ceremony, at your invitation.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Per\u00edandros"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_2067_1#8$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "A son of Corinia's merchants just happens to pass by as I am talking to the Sargonian ambassador, and casually drops a solution to the problem at hand that leads to tonight's vote.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lydia"
    },
    {
        "text": "Was this all Kereseira's will?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lydia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_2078_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Why not?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Per\u00edandros"
    },
    {
        "text": "Tradition dictates that any Minoan who has received the heroes' blessing must visit a temple the following day to declare it before a priest.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Per\u00edandros"
    },
    {
        "text": "But you will not seek Hi\u00e9reia Kassandra no matter what, no matter how close the Astynomos' Office is to Endymion Temple, will you?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Per\u00edandros"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_2067_1#8$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lydia"
    },
    {
        "text": "You're crossing the line, Hiere\u00fas Per\u00edandros.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lydia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_2078_1#7$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "You know as well as I do that the election of Kyr\u00eda Mashayer will be more than just a feather in your diplomat's cap. Your foremost concern will always be Minos itself, as it is for me.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Per\u00edandros"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_2067_1#8$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Speak your demands. You can spin all the words you want, but I will not assent before seeing the terms and conditions of the deal.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lydia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_2078_1#10$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Have patience, Honored Astynomos.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Per\u00edandros"
    },
    {
        "text": "Reputation is the most important thing in business. And I will bring my business to you personally, once the dust has settled.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Per\u00edandros"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_2078_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's not that time yet.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Per\u00edandros"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_2067_1#8$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lydia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 0,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "69_g9_templetheater_n",
        "screenadapt": "coverall",
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#1$1",
        "focus": "all"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#1$1",
        "focus": "all"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "In accordance with tradition, please etch 'Yea' or 'Nay' onto the ostracon you are holding.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Pallas"
    },
    {
        "text": "Then, place it in the box face-down.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Pallas"
    },
    {
        "text": "We will tally the results once everyone has cast their ostraca.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Pallas"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#16$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "If more than half the votes are in favor, Titi... Kyr\u00eda Mashayer shall be named supervisor of the temple project, until the exchange ceremony is completed.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Pallas"
    },
    {
        "text": "Begin.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Pallas"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#10$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Titi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "duration": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_crwddiscuss_outside",
        "loop": true,
        "channel": "bgs",
        "volume": 0
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 0,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "soundvolume",
        "volume": 0.4,
        "channel": "bgs",
        "fadetime": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0.3,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle",
        "text": "The crowd walks up, one by one, to place their ostraca.",
        "x": 300,
        "y": 370,
        "alignment": "center",
        "size": 24,
        "delay": 0.04,
        "width": 700
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle",
        "text": "There is some distance between the box and the center of the square where Titi is standing, but she can see the smiling faces of the friends she has made these past few days.",
        "x": 300,
        "y": 370,
        "alignment": "center",
        "size": 24,
        "delay": 0.04,
        "width": 700
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle",
        "text": "They nod to Titi as their gazes meet.",
        "x": 300,
        "y": 370,
        "alignment": "center",
        "size": 24,
        "delay": 0.04,
        "width": 700
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle",
        "text": "She cannot see the words on their ostraca, but she knows what vote they cast.",
        "x": 300,
        "y": 370,
        "alignment": "center",
        "size": 24,
        "delay": 0.04,
        "width": 700
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle",
        "text": "Who would have thought that she would be in charge of the construction of a Minoan temple? It would have been a tremendous honor, even in Padishah Malla's time.",
        "x": 300,
        "y": 370,
        "alignment": "center",
        "size": 24,
        "delay": 0.04,
        "width": 700
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle",
        "text": "How should she repay the kindness the Athenians have shown her?",
        "x": 300,
        "y": 370,
        "alignment": "center",
        "size": 24,
        "delay": 0.04,
        "width": 700
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopmusic",
        "fadetime": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Hah. What a joke.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopsound",
        "channel": "bgs",
        "fadetime": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "A voice interrupts Titi's thoughts, and causes the square to fall silent."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_walk_n"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2081_1#1$1",
        "duration": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Is this the year 1100?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Depressed Man"
    },
    {
        "text": "I thought maybe we were at the turn of the millennium, and the Sargonians had come back to rule us.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Depressed Man"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#20$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#12$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Pallas"
    },
    {
        "text": "The war is over, Megas.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Pallas"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2081_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "For you, maybe. Not for me.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Depressed Man"
    },
    {
        "text": "The hated Sargonians continue to hound me in my darkest dreams.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Depressed Man"
    },
    {
        "text": "I wish I were as forgetful as you. But our heroes tell me in my dreams that I must not forget.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Depressed Man"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#4$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#12$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Did a priest interpret that for you?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Pallas"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2081_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Depressed Man"
    },
    {
        "text": "No. But these recurring dreams are the heroes' voice. I alone know their will.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Depressed Man"
    },
    {
        "text": "I will never smile and work alongside a Sargonian.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Depressed Man"
    },
    {
        "text": "I will not stand for it, no matter what good things you may say the Sargonian has done.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Depressed Man"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopmusic",
        "fadetime": 2
    },
