    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "playmusic",
        "intro": "$dignified_intro",
        "key": "$dignified_loop",
        "volume": 0.6
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_crwddiscuss_outside",
        "loop": true,
        "channel": "bgs",
        "volume": 0
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_rapidbreath_female",
        "loop": true,
        "channel": 1,
        "volume": 0
    },
    {
        "text": "Titi watches as the Minoan passes in front of her without so much as casting a glance her way."
    },
    {
        "text": "He tosses his ostracon as he passes by the box. It hits the side and falls onto the ground, rolling a few times before settling face-up. The ostracon is blank."
    },
    {
        "text": "Titi realizes that his hatred of Sargonians is such that he would not dignify this vote by participating."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "soundvolume",
        "volume": 0.8,
        "channel": "bgs",
        "fadetime": 3
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 3.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "hidecgitem",
        "image": "cgitem_69_i04_1",
        "fadetime": 3
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 3.5
    },
    {
        "text": "Her cheeks burn as though she has been slapped in the face, but she trembles as she feels a chill run up her spine."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "soundvolume",
        "volume": 0.6,
        "channel": "bgs",
        "fadetime": 4
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 3.5
    },
    {
        "text": "Everything seems to grow distant. It is as though there is a thick screen separating her and the others, and all the sounds around her."
    },
    {
        "text": "In her daze, she seems to perceive Pallas stepping up, and the craftsmen casting concerned glances at her."
    },
    {
        "text": "She wants to say that she is fine, she is alright, that she was prepared for such treatment, as an envoy of peace sent by the erstwhile invaders and oppressors."
    },
    {
        "text": "Besides, it's not as though the Minoan has done anything to her. He simply said he did not want to work with her. This is fine; no one can be loved by everyone, after all."
    },
    {
        "text": "She wants to smile, that famous bright, carefree smile of Medjehtiqedti Nasutu Mashayer's, which has charmed so many visitors to her museum."
    },
    {
        "text": "But she cannot find the words, or her smile."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "soundvolume",
        "volume": 0.2,
        "channel": "bgs",
        "fadetime": 4
    },
    {
        "tag": "hidecgitem",
        "image": "cgitem_69_i04_2",
        "fadetime": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "hidecgitem",
        "image": "cgitem_69_i04_4",
        "fadetime": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 4.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_tinnitus_loop",
        "loop": true,
        "channel": 2,
        "volume": 0
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopsound",
        "channel": "bgs",
        "fadetime": 4
    },
    {
        "tag": "hidecgitem",
        "image": "cgitem_69_i04_3",
        "fadetime": 3
    },
    {
        "tag": "soundvolume",
        "volume": 0.2,
        "channel": 1,
        "fadetime": 3
    },
    {
        "tag": "soundvolume",
        "volume": 0.6,
        "channel": 2,
        "fadetime": 3
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 4.5
    },
    {
        "text": "The words of the Minoan who tossed the ostracon echo in her mind. She recalls the ferryman who questioned her the day she arrived in Athenius."
    },
    {
        "text": "The time she spent with the temple craftsmen meant something. They still trust her."
    },
    {
        "text": "But to the countless Minoan strangers out there, she is not Titi, the curious lover of Minoan legend. She is a Sargonian."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopsound",
        "channel": 1,
        "fadetime": 6
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopsound",
        "channel": 2,
        "fadetime": 6
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopmusic",
        "fadetime": 4
    },
    {
        "tag": "image",
        "image": "69_i05",
        "fadetime": 5,
        "screenadapt": "coverall"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 5.5
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mio"
    },
    {
        "text": "Everyone's gone, and the lights are out. How long are you planning to keep yourself curled up here? That Forte girl and the craftsmen were worried sick about you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mio"
    },
    {
        "text": "What are you gonna do, tell them to go on holiday while you fix the temple overnight with your hands and ribbons? That'll make things square, will it?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mio"
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Titi"
    },
    {
        "text": "I've been circling your feet and winking at you for ages. It never occurred to you to look down? Never noticed that something wasn't quite right?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mio"
    },
    {
        "text": "Did you notice that a-hole deputy excusing himself from the voting ceremony and distancing himself from the whole thing? Did you notice the words 'ulterior motives' written all over that Astynomos? No, you just couldn't resist jumping into the grave that's been dug just for you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mio"
    },
    {
        "text": "Now look where it's gotten you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mio"
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Titi"
    },
    {
        "text": "Really? You're crying over <i>that?</i> I can't even tell you how many times I've seen it in the City of Gold, where licking boots and stamping on faces is as much a part of everyday life as eating and shitting.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mio"
    },
    {
        "text": "Besides, I doubt you're crying for the people who used you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mio"
    },
    {
        "text": "I told you when you got the padishah's assignment that it wasn't gonna be a pleasant vacation.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mio"
    },
    {
        "text": "The scars of history that run deep, the Minoans who are still recovering from the pain, and your position as the ambassador of Sargon, all serve to remind you that it is not just an exchange of relics that you have to deal with.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mio"
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Titi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playmusic",
        "intro": "$warm_intro",
        "key": "$warm_loop",
        "volume": 0.6
    },
    {
        "text": "The proud creature tries to catch a glimpse of the young Feline's face, in a rare show of concern, but her head is bowed too low for it to see."
    },
    {
        "text": "Mio sighs and pokes Titi's hand with its head, cuddling around her and gestures for her to pet it."
    },
    {
        "text": "Furry makes one happy. Your words.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mio"
    },
    {
        "text": "I give you special permission to stroke my tail, fluff the hair on my back, or wipe your tears on either.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mio"
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mio"
    },
    {
        "text": "Actually, I take back the last one. I hate getting wet.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mio"
    },
    {
        "text": "Why did I even pick a trouble-making little thing like you? Now I'm on consolation duty.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mio"
    },
    {
        "text": "Heh...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Titi"
    },
    {
        "text": "If I am really so fragile, you wouldn't have picked me when you left the Grand Bazaar, would you?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Titi"
    },
    {
        "text": "Just this one time to lift your mood. Don't you dare get carried away.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mio"
    },
    {
        "text": "Thanks, Mio.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Titi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
