    },
    {
        "text": "Feeling better?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mio"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#9$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Yes. Some people voted for me. It means they trust me and have hopes for me.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Titi"
    },
    {
        "text": "Manos called me one of them.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Titi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#10$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "People don't always get along, even in the same family. And I'm in a country that was deeply hurt by Sargon in the past.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Titi"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm not a hero of legend. I can't miraculously solve everything with a song, a poem, or a speech.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Titi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#9$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "What I can do is to get Kereseira's First Temple completed as soon as possible, and return to the Minoans, to Kereseira, the things that belong to Minos.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Titi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
